-6 sm:p-8 lg:grid-cols-[0.9fr_1.1fr] lg:items-center"><div><h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Built for these businesses</h3><p class="text-muted-foreground mt-2 text-sm">Retail OS<!-- --> is configured per format — the screens, masters and reports change with the way you operate.</p><ul class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-2"><li class="border-border bg-background rounded-full border px-3 py-1.5 text-sm font-medium">Kirana / neighbourhood</li><li class="border-border bg-background rounded-full border px-3 py-1.5 text-sm font-medium">Supermarket</li><li class="border-border bg-background rounded-full border px-3 py-1.5 text-sm font-medium">Pharmacy</li><li class="border-border bg-background rounded-full border px-3 py-1.5 text-sm font-medium">Garments / multi-store</li><li class="border-border bg-background rounded-full border px-3 py-1.5 text-sm font-medium">FMCG distribution</li></ul></div><div class="grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2"><a class="group border-border bg-card hover:border-brand-400 flex items-center gap-3 rounded-2xl border p-4 transition" href="/industries/retail/"><span class="bg-brand-100 text-foreground flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shopping-bag h-5 w-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 10a4 4 0 0 1-8 0"></path><path d="M3.103 6.034h17.794"></path><path d="M3.4 5.467a2 2 0 0 0-.4 1.2V20a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V6.667a2 2 0 0 0-.4-1.2l-2-2.667A2 2 0 0 0 17 2H7a2 2 0 0 0-1.6.8z"></path></svg></span><span class="min-w-0"><span class="block text-sm font-semibold">Retail</span><span class="text-muted-foreground block truncate text-xs">Kirana · Supermarket · Pharmacy</span></span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" str