uted-foreground mt-1.5 text-sm">The cashier sells from whichever box is in front, and the expired stock surfaces weeks later at the physical audit.</p></div><div class="bg-brand-50 ring-brand-200 mt-auto rounded-xl p-4 ring-1"><div class="text-brand-800 flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-[0.14em] uppercase"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-sparkles h-3.5 w-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M11.017 2.814a1 1 0 0 1 1.966 0l1.051 5.558a2 2 0 0 0 1.594 1.594l5.558 1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.966l-5.558 1.051a2 2 0 0 0-1.594 1.594l-1.051 5.558a1 1 0 0 1-1.966 0l-1.051-5.558a2 2 0 0 0-1.594-1.594l-5.558-1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.966l5.558-1.051a2 2 0 0 0 1.594-1.594z"></path><path d="M20 2v4"></path><path d="M22 4h-4"></path><circle cx="4" cy="20" r="2"></circle></svg>With <!-- -->Retail OS</div><p class="text-foreground/85 mt-1.5 text-sm">Inventory &amp; Batches flags the batch as it is scanned, and POS &amp; GST Billing picks the right batch and MRP before the bill prints.</p></div></div></article><article class="border-border bg-card flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border shadow-sm"><h3 class="border-border border-b px-6 py-4 text-base font-semibold tracking-tight">Stock moves from Kothrud to Baner</h3><div class="flex flex-1 flex-col gap-4 p-6"><div><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-[0.14em] text-rose-700 uppercase"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-clock h-3.5 w-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"></path></svg>Today</div><p class="text-muted-foreground mt-1.5 text-sm">A WhatsApp message asks for 20 cartons, stock goes over in an