iry</h3><p class="mt-1.5 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Pharmacy and FMCG-grade lot control at sale and GRN.</p></div><div class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-list-checks h-4 w-4 text-brand-700" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M13 5h8"></path><path d="M13 12h8"></path><path d="M13 19h8"></path><path d="m3 17 2 2 4-4"></path><path d="m3 7 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><h3 class="mt-3 text-sm font-semibold tracking-tight">Purchase &amp; GRN</h3><p class="mt-1.5 text-sm text-muted-foreground">PO, receipt, QC and landed cost.</p></div><div class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-list-checks h-4 w-4 text-brand-700" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M13 5h8"></path><path d="M13 12h8"></path><path d="M13 19h8"></path><path d="m3 17 2 2 4-4"></path><path d="m3 7 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><h3 class="mt-3 text-sm font-semibold tracking-tight">Multi-store</h3><p class="mt-1.5 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Central catalog, store prices, stock transfer, consolidated reports.</p></div><div class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-list-checks h-4 w-4 text-brand-700" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M13 5h8"></path><path d="M13 12h8"></path><path d="M13 19h8"></path><path d="m3 17 2 2 4-4"></path><path d="m3 7 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><h3 class="mt-3 text-sm font-semibold tracking-tight">Reorder &amp; audit</h3><p class="mt-1.5 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Low-stock, physical