b for the people who will live in it.</p></div><div class="mt-12 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2"><div class="flex gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-5"><span class="flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-foreground text-brand-600"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-user h-5 w-5" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"></circle><path d="M7 20.662V19a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1.662"></path></svg></span><div><h3 class="text-base font-semibold tracking-tight">Cashier</h3><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground">A till that does not surprise them mid-queue.</p></div></div><div class="flex gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-5"><span class="flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-foreground text-brand-600"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-user h-5 w-5" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"></circle><path d="M7 20.662V19a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1.662"></path></svg></span><div><h3 class="text-base font-semibold tracking-tight">Store manager</h3><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Stock, cashiers, and today’s number without waiting for HO.</p></div></div><div class="flex gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-5"><span class="flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-foreground text-brand-600"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-user h-5 w-5" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"></circle><path d="M7 20.662V19a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1.662"></path></svg></span><div><h3 class="text-base font-semibold tracking-tight">Purchase</h3><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground">What to order, from whom, and what actually arrived.</p></div></div><div class="flex gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-5"><span class="flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-foreground text-brand-600"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-user h-5 w-5" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"></circle><path d="M7 20.662V19a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1.662"></path></svg></span><div><h3 class="text-base font-semibold tracking-tight">Owner / HO</h3><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Every store’s sales, margin and stock in one place.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="relative isolate py-16 sm:py-24 lg:py-28 bg-muted/40"><div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 -z-10" style="background:radial-gradient(ellipse 50% 40% at 0% 100%, rgb(245 158 11 / 0.12), transparent 70%)"></div><div class="container-default"><div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center"><div class="mb-4 flex justify-center"><span class="chip-brand inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em]"><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-foreground"></span>How you get started</span></div><h2 class="text-balance text-3xl font-semibold sm:text-4xl lg:text-[42px] lg:leading-[1.08]">Four steps from this page to a live workspace.</h2><p class="mt-4 text-pretty text-base text-muted-foreground sm:text-lg">There is no anonymous credit-card signup